    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______.",
